---
import BaseLayout from "../../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import MetaPill from "../../../components/ui/MetaPill.astro";
import registry from "../../../data/phase-96-mobility-transportation-freight-communications-digital-networks-territorial-access-registry.json";
const mobility = registry.passenger_mobility_demand_accessibility_affordability_inclusion_dossiers;
const services = registry.multimodal_transportation_service_planning_operations_safety_reliability_ledgers;
const freight = registry.freight_goods_movement_intermodal_logistics_delivery_resilience_registers;
const digital = registry.communications_broadband_mobile_digital_public_infrastructure_interoperability_territorial_access_ledgers;
---

<BaseLayout title="Mobility, Transportation, Freight, Communications, Digital Networks And Territorial Access | FTFN" description="Thirty-two inactive mobility-access, transportation-service, freight-delivery, and digital-access records.">
  <section class="page-section hero" data-mobility-transportation-freight-digital-access-registry><div class="hero__copy"><div class="eyebrow">FTFN / Mobility And Network Access</div><h1 class="page-title">Infrastructure availability is not usable access, and network coverage is not affordable reliable connectivity.</h1><p class="lede">Phase 96 traces passenger mobility demand, affordability and inclusion; multimodal planning, operations, safety and reliability; freight and completed delivery; then communications, digital public infrastructure, interoperability, universal connectivity, emergency restoration and territorial access.</p><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label="8 inactive mobility dossiers" tone="possibility" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive service ledgers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive freight registers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive digital ledgers" /><MetaPill label="0 mobility or access decisions" tone="review" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Travel Demand, Accessibility, Affordability And Inclusion</div><h2>Eight mobility-access dossiers remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/travel-demand-accessibility-proximity-complete-trips-001/">Read the complete-trips guide</a></div><div class="grid">{mobility.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.mobility_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/mobility-transportation-freight-communications-digital-networks/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Trip purpose, origins, destinations, proximity, accessibility, affordability, safety, inclusion, review and receipts remain empty.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Multimodal Transportation Service, Operations, Safety And Reliability</div><h2>Eight service ledgers contain no completed-trip or safe-mobility decision.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/public-transit-rail-schedules-fares-service-quality-001/">Read the transportation-service guide</a></div><div class="grid">{services.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.service_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="22 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/mobility-transportation-freight-communications-digital-networks/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.multimodal_transportation_service_planning_operations_safety_reliability_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Networks, schedules, fares, vehicles, workforce, operations, safety, accessibility, reliability and continuity remain unassessed.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Freight, Goods Movement, Intermodal Logistics And Delivery Resilience</div><h2>Eight freight registers remain inactive.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/freight-intermodal-terminals-last-mile-reliable-delivery-001/">Read the reliable-delivery guide</a></div><div class="source-list">{freight.map((record) => <article class="source-row"><div><h3><a href={'/evidence/mobility-transportation-freight-communications-digital-networks/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.freight_goods_movement_intermodal_logistics_delivery_resilience_register_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Shipments, custody, routes, terminals, borders, workers, costs, externalities, continuity and completed delivery remain unassessed.</p></div><MetaPill label={record.freight_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Communications, Digital Public Infrastructure And Territorial Access</div><h2>Eight digital-access ledgers contain no connectivity decision.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/communications-broadband-mobile-satellite-universal-connectivity-001/">Read the universal-connectivity guide</a></div><div class="grid">{digital.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><h3><a href={'/evidence/mobility-transportation-freight-communications-digital-networks/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.communications_broadband_mobile_digital_public_infrastructure_interoperability_territorial_access_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Coverage, performance, affordability, devices, accessibility, interoperability, privacy, security, outages, restoration and community use remain inactive.</p><MetaPill label={record.digital_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section briefing-band"><div class="briefing-band__copy"><div class="eyebrow">Public Contract</div><h2>Inspect the empty mobility and network-access state.</h2><p>The export publishes the complete control surface without treating infrastructure as access, schedules as trips, throughput as safety, movement as delivery, coverage as connectivity, or restoration as recovery—and without scoring, ranking, routing or deciding for a person, operator, carrier, provider, place or jurisdiction.</p></div><article class="record-card"><a class="inline-link" href="/data/mobility-transportation-freight-communications-digital-networks-territorial-access.json">Mobility, transportation, freight and digital-access JSON</a></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
